build/
run/
output/
*.o
*.pyc
__pycache__/
tests/t[0-9]*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [v1.3.1] Run output never goes in the repository.
#
# `output/` above only catches a run made where the case expects it. A case run
# somewhere else -- examples/03_abiotic_kinetics/Case3/, say, which is how it
# actually happens -- was not covered, and 6 MB of .vti sat there waiting to be
# committed by the next "commit all".
#
# These are results. They are reproducible from the code and the configuration,
# they are large, and git stores every version of them forever. The geometry
# files are the exception and stay tracked: *.dat is deliberately NOT listed
# here, because 26 of them are inputs that cases need in order to run at all.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.vti
*.chk
*.out
*.err
*.log
